{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國總統當勞·特朗普將於12月4日出席台積電（TSMC）位於亞利桑那州鳳凰城（菲尼克斯）的晶片工廠擴建項目的奠基儀式。預計台積電高管、供應商及客户屆時將出席。目前尚不清楚英偉達行政總裁黃仁勳是否會現身，因為他定於前一天在美國參議院出席聽證會。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588154.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:23:49.855626+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T04:13:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:12.143706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:12.143706+00:00","content_hash":"b2109a3e56387a211fc953012f1a5f0d8e4c5cd12b9010dd443784ff27812f62","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}